  "mainHtml": "<main class=\"bg-white\"><div class=\"bg-off-white\"><div class=\"container mx-auto px-4\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-1 mb-8 pt-8 lg:mb-16 breadcrumb\"><a href=\"/en/questions\">Home</a><i class=\"icon\">chevron_right</i><a href=\"/en/question_categories/account\">Account</a><i class=\"icon\">chevron_right</i><span>I can’t log in — what should I do?</span></div><div class=\"lg:flex gap-16 mb-16\"><div class=\"lg:w-3/4\"><h1 class=\"font-serif text-5xl mb-8\">I can’t log in — what should I do?</h1><div class=\"bg-white rounded-lg p-8 auction-body\"><p><b>Check your sign‑in method</b>. You must use the <b>same method</b> you used when you created your account.&nbsp;</p><p></p><ul><li><b>Signed up with BankID?</b> Choose <i>Sign in with BankID.</i> Email + password will not work for that account.&nbsp;</li><li><b>Signed up with email &amp; password?</b> Use your email and password. BankID sign‑in will not work for that account.</li></ul><p><b>Not sure how you signed up?</b>&nbsp;</p><p></p><ul><li>Try BankID. If you’re prompted to create a new account, <i>cancel</i> and try email + password instead.&nbsp;</li><li>Try <i>Forgot password</i>? with your email. If no email arrives within a few minutes, you likely don’t have an email/password account with that address.</li></ul><p><b>Username is not a login option</b>. \"Username\" is only the name shown when you place bids. It cannot be used to sign in.</p><p><b>Still stuck?</b>&nbsp;</p><p></p><ul><li>Double‑check the spelling of your email address.&nbsp;</li><li>Make sure you’re using the correct BankID profile (right national ID number).&nbsp;</li><li>Drop us an email <i>support@biddershighway.com</i></li></ul><p></p><p></p><p></p></div></div><div class=\"lg:w-1/4 mt-8 lg:mt-0\"><h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold mb-6\">Categories</h2><ul class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2 lg:block\"><li><a href=\"/en/questions\" class=\"block lg:px-4 lg:py-3 font-semibold text-neutral-500 hover:text-neutral-600 transition-colors border rounded border-transparent\">All</a></li><li><a href=\"/en/question_categories/buying\" class=\"block lg:px-4 lg:py-3 font-semibold text-neutral-500 hover:text-neutral-600 transition-colors border rounded border-transparent\">Buying</a></li><li><a href=\"/en/question_categories/selling\" class=\"block lg:px-4 lg:py-3 font-semibold text-neutral-500 hover:text-neutral-600 transition-colors border rounded border-transparent\">Selling</a></li><li><a href=\"/en/question_categories/bidding\" class=\"block lg:px-4 lg:py-3 font-semibold text-neutral-500 hover:text-neutral-600 transition-colors border rounded border-transparent\">Bidding</a></li><li><a href=\"/en/question_categories/documentation\" class=\"block lg:px-4 lg:py-3 font-semibold text-neutral-500 hover:text-neutral-600 transition-colors border rounded border-transparent\">Documentation</a></li><li><a href=\"/en/question_categories/account\" class=\"block lg:px-4 lg:py-3 font-semibold text-neutral-500 hover:text-neutral-600 transition-colors border rounded border-transparent px-2 border-black! text-black! hover:text-black!\">Account</a></li><li><a href=\"/en/question_categories/payment\" class=\"block lg:px-4 lg:py-3 font-semibold text-neutral-500 hover:text-neutral-600 transition-colors border rounded border-transparent\">Payments</a></li><li><a href=\"/en/question_categories/shipping\" class=\"block lg:px-4 lg:py-3 font-semibold text-neutral-500 hover:text-neutral-600 transition-colors border rounded border-transparent\">Shipping</a></li><li><a href=\"/en/question_categories/verification\" class=\"block lg:px-4 lg:py-3 font-semibold text-neutral-500 hover:text-neutral-600 transition-colors border rounded border-transparent\">Verification</a></li></ul></div></div></div><div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 pb-16\"><div class=\"w-full p-8 bg-amber-100 rounded sm:flex justify-between items-center\"><div><h2 class=\"font-serif text-2xl sm:text-4xl mb-4\">Other questions?</h2><p class=\"text-sm sm:text-base mb-2 sm:mb-8\">You can send us an email. We'll be happy to help!</p><a href=\"mailto:support@biddershighway.com\" class=\"font-bold underline hover:text-neutral-800\">support@biddershighway.com</a></div><a href=\"mailto:support@biddershighway.com\" class=\"hidden sm:block\"><img src=\"/assets/contact-us-4411369c.svg\" alt=\"Contact us\" class=\"w-48 h-36\"></a></div></div><div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 text-center py-8\"><a href=\"/en\" class=\"inline-block rounded-sm cursor-pointer transition-colors px-4 py-2 text-white bg-jaffa hover:bg-zest disabled:bg-yellow-700 disabled:text-neutral-300 px-6 py-3\">View all our car auctions</a></div></div></main>",
